{"t":"CI","made":"2026-11-10 08:51","name":"The Cigna Group","ko":null,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Healthcare Plans","employees":65669,"hq":"Bloomfield, CT, United States","website":"https://www.thecignagroup.com","summary_en":"The Cigna Group, together with its subsidiaries, provides insurance and related products and services in the United States. It operates through two segments: Evernorth Health Services and Cigna Healthcare. The Evernorth Health Services segment includes Pharmacy Benefit Services and Specialty and Care Services, offering pharmacy benefit management, drug claim adjudication, retail pharmacy network administration, benefit design consultation, drug utilization review, drug formulary management, pharmacy benefits, home delivery pharmacy, specialty pharmacy, specialty pharmaceutical distribution, and clinical programs for whole-person health outcomes. The Cigna Healthcare segment comprises U.S. Healthcare and International Health, delivering comprehensive medical and coordinated solutions such as employer medical plans, individual and family plans, behavioral health, consumer health engagement, dental, pharmacy management, stop-loss insurance, global health care, and local health care solutions, as well as health care benefits for mobile individuals and employees of multinational organizations. The company offers other operations, including corporate-owned life insurance, reinsurance, and certain run-off and non-strategic businesses. The company distributes its products and services through brokers and consultants; directly to employers, unions and other groups, or individuals; and private and public exchanges. The company was formerly known as Cigna Corporation and changed its name to The Cigna Group in February 2023. The company was founded in 1792 and is headquartered in Bloomfield, Connecticut.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Cigna Group은 자회사와 함께 미국에서 보험 및 관련 상품과 서비스를 제공합니다. Evernorth Health Services와 Cigna Healthcare의 두 부문으로 운영됩니다. Evernorth 건강 서비스 부문에는 약국 혜택 관리, 약물 청구 판결, 소매 약국 네트워크 관리, 혜택 설계 상담, 약물 사용 검토, 약물 처방집 관리, 약국 혜택, 가정 배달 약국, 전문 약국, 전문 의약품 유통 및 전인 건강 결과를 위한 임상 프로그램을 제공하는 약국 혜택 서비스 및 전문 진료 서비스가 포함됩니다. Cigna Healthcare 부문은 미국 의료 및 국제 건강으로 구성되어 고용주 의료 계획, 개인 및 가족 계획, 행동 건강, 소비자 건강 참여, 치과, 약국 관리, 손실 방지 보험, 글로벌 건강 관리 및 지역 건강 관리 솔루션뿐만 아니라 이동하는 개인 및 다국적 조직의 직원을 위한 건강 관리 혜택과 같은 포괄적인 의료 및 조정 솔루션을 제공합니다. 회사는 기업 소유 생명보험, 재보험, 특정 결손 및 비전략적 사업을 포함한 기타 사업을 제공합니다. 회사는 브로커와 컨설턴트를 통해 제품과 서비스를 배포합니다. 고용주, 노동조합, 기타 단체 또는 개인에게 직접적으로; 그리고 민간 및 공공 교류. 이 회사는 이전에 Cigna Corporation으로 알려졌으며 2023년 2월에 Cigna Group으로 이름을 변경했습니다. 이 회사는 1792년에 설립되었으며 코네티컷 주 블룸필드에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":295.6,"mcap":77891354624.0,"pe":13.03351,"fpe":8.857064,"peg":0.8058,"ps":0.27204588,"pb":1.7974632,"ev_ebitda":7.968,"div":2.13,"beta":0.246,"hi52":318.05,"lo52":256.52},"fin":{"rev":286316986368.0,"rev_g":0.056,"eps_g":-0.216,"gross":0.09087,"op":0.03481,"net":0.020920001,"roe":0.15648,"fcf":8189125120.0,"cash":7295000064.0,"debt":31142000640.0,"de":71.227,"eps":22.68,"feps":33.37449},"own":{"short":0.0286,"inst":0.92945,"insider":0.0144299995},"analyst":{"n":25,"mean":342.9616,"median":340.0,"high":400.0,"low":288.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.84,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":5,"buy":12,"hold":8,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":12,"hold":7,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":6,"buy":12,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":6,"buy":13,"hold":5,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-09","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":320.0,"priorPriceTarget":310.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Evercore ISI Group","ToGrade":"In-Line","FromGrade":"In-Line","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":320.0,"priorPriceTarget":290.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Guggenheim","ToGrade":